// Hand-migrated from legacy/src/test/resources/sample/execution.flow (v2) to v3.
//
// The original drove a third-party booking site through inline XPaths. The
// migration keeps every scenario name and every step, in order, and rewrites the
// targets as the phrases the same controls carry on apps/sample-web, which is
// what the flow can actually be recorded and replayed against (REQ-NFR-8).
//
// The flow books and pays, so it declares a compensating story: a failure after
// the booking is created runs "cancel booking" before the flow stops
// (REQ-AUTO-4).

scenario: start booking
  Click the Book a slot link

scenario: perform search
  Click the location field
  Clear the location field
  Type "indra" into the location field
  Click the Indiranagar suggestion
  Click the next button

scenario: select date and time
  Click the slot date field
  Type "2026-09-03" into the slot date field
  Select "09:00" in the slot times select
  Click the next button
  Select "18:00" in the slot times select
  Click the next button
  Wait 8 seconds

scenario (onFailure=compensate:cancel booking): select slot and login
  Click the Book now button
  Click the username field
  Type {data.user.email} into the username field
  Click the login button
  Type {data.user.password} into the password field

scenario (onFailure=compensate:cancel booking): checkout the selected slot
  Click the booking result
  Click the Checkout link

scenario (onFailure=compensate:cancel booking): initiate payment
  Click the card number field
  Click the expiry month select
  Select "08" in the expiry month select
  Click the expiry year select
  Select "2027" in the expiry year select
  Click the CVV field
  Type {data.card.cvv} into the CVV field
  Click the card number field
  Type {data.card.number} into the card number field

scenario: cancel booking
  Click the Bookings link
  Click the cancel booking button

scenario: logout
  Click the sidebar toggle
  Click the logout link

compose: book and pay
  start booking
  perform search
  select date and time
  select slot and login
  checkout the selected slot
  initiate payment
  logout

test: book and pay
